# Dystopia: metals and alloys of the City.

reagent-physical-desc-dystopia-molten = glowing
reagent-name-dystopia-tin = tin
reagent-desc-dystopia-tin = A soft silvery metal.
reagent-name-dystopia-chromium = chromium
reagent-desc-dystopia-chromium = A hard bluish-grey metal.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-iron = molten iron
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-iron = Blinding yellow liquid iron. Alone it casts a soft bar; with coal it becomes steel. Solidifies at 1538 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-cast-iron = molten cast iron
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-cast-iron = Liquid cast iron, iron saturated with carbon. Pours easily, but its castings are brittle. Solidifies at 1200 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-steel = molten steel
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-steel = Liquid steel, the stuff the City stands on. Every plate of its walls was once like this. Solidifies at 1450 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-copper = molten copper
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-copper = Liquid copper with a greenish glow above it. Drawn into wire, alloyed into bronze and brass. Solidifies at 1085 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-aluminium = molten aluminium
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-aluminium = Liquid aluminium: silvery, sluggish and barely glowing. Deceptively so; it burns like the rest. Solidifies at 660 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-zinc = molten zinc
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-zinc = Liquid zinc. White fumes curl off it; do not breathe them. Alloyed with copper into brass. Solidifies at 420 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-tin = molten tin
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-tin = Liquid tin, as runny as mercury. With copper it makes bronze, with lead solder. Solidifies at 232 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-lead = molten lead
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-lead = Dull, heavy liquid lead. Shot and bullets are cast from it. Solidifies at 327 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-gold = molten gold
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-gold = Liquid gold. It keeps its colour even in the fire. Solidifies at 1064 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-silver = molten silver
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-silver = Liquid silver, painfully white. Solidifies at 962 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-uranium = molten uranium
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-uranium = Liquid uranium. Hot twice over, from the fire and from itself. Keep your distance. Solidifies at 1132 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-brass = molten brass
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-brass = Liquid brass, copper with zinc, the colour of old gold. Solidifies at 930 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-bronze = molten bronze
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-bronze = Liquid bronze, copper with tin. What must stand for centuries is cast from it. Solidifies at 950 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-solder = molten solder
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-solder = Liquid solder, tin with lead. Sets almost as soon as it cools. Solidifies at 183 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-stainless-steel = molten stainless steel
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-stainless-steel = Liquid stainless steel, steel with chromium. It does not rust, does not tarnish and does not forgive. Solidifies at 1450 °C.
reagent-name-dystopia-molten-ferrochrome = molten ferrochrome
reagent-desc-dystopia-molten-ferrochrome = Liquid ferrochrome, chromium with iron. Nearly useless alone: it is added to steel. Solidifies at 1600 °C.
